# Data Ownership

Each task and booking will contain a `userId`.

Example:

```javascript
const task = {
    userId: currentUser.uid,
    title: "Complete project",
    category: "JavaScript",
    dueDate: "2026-09-10",
    priority: "High",
    completed: false,
    createdAt: new Date().toISOString()
};
```

This allows the application to associate records with the authenticated user.

